---
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: aws-meta
data:
  #| The chart reads this key as an optional configMapKeyRef for
     AWS_EC2_ENDPOINT, so the endpoint arrives with no values override. It is
     spelled out in full because the SDK builds endpoints from its compiled-in
     partition table rather than from the services domain IMDS hands out, and
     it never guesses a port. #|
  endpoint: "#{ spinifex.ec2_endpoint }#"
